      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Emerald_Isle%2C_North_Carolina",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Emerald Isle’s beaches are a protected nesting ground for sea turtles, safeguarded by federal law.",
