      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Emerald_Isle%2C_North_Carolina",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Owners limited commercial development and mobile homes to five blocks each to keep Emerald Isle family‑oriented.",
